WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.530
In this lesson, you will learn to make something happen when two characters touch (bump), and use bumps in game rules.

2
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:17.583
The yellow “start on bump” block runs when another character touches this one.

3
00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:23.765
An apple can hide when the hero bumps it — collected!

4
00:00:24.365 --> 00:00:29.513
A monster can make the hero shrink when they bump.

5
00:00:29.513 --> 00:00:31.913
Watch out!

6
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:36.791
Bumps make rules: good bumps and bad bumps.

7
00:00:37.391 --> 00:00:43.409
Bump into each apple (gem) and collect it, then grow from eating!

8
00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.809
Bump, munch, grow!

9
00:00:46.409 --> 00:00:50.252
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:55.400
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
